  [[[2], [1]], [[4], [3]]]

  Randomly flip multiple images.

  >>> images = np.array(
  ... [
  ...     [[[1], [2]], [[3], [4]]],
  ...     [[[5], [6]], [[7], [8]]]
  ... ])
